05:37:46.100 --> 05:37:51.100
This amendment essentially changes parts of the provisions of law.

05:37:51.100 --> 05:38:04.100
And on page three of the amendment, you'll see the underlying portion that just in addition to our current hate crimes statutes that include race, color, religion, ethnicity, national origin.

05:38:04.100 --> 05:38:20.100
Or sexual orientation of the victim of the offense was motivated. We are adding gender identity. So that way, if someone does create assault someone because of their gender identity, because they're following our law that they are added to our hate crimes.

