I do appreciate the leader refreshing my recollection because I wasn't thinking that we're going to be at this point this late in the afternoon, but he did point out the distinction that was the thrust of my questions, and that is under under this amendment.

05:40:43.100 --> 05:40:52.100
It would make these types of offenses hate crimes as opposed to civil violations of either the Americans with disability.

05:40:52.100 --> 05:41:03.100
Excuse me, under either the Civil Rights Act or under the Kansas Act against discrimination. And by the way, I referred a few moments ago to the ADA.

05:41:04.100 --> 05:41:14.100
That may have applicability and some other context related to the bill, but that was not the thrust of what I was referring to and I apologize if I misled anyone.

05:41:14.100 --> 05:41:18.100
Sounds like a very good idea to me long overdue. Thank you.

