Well, I do hope that since it seems like this is on the fast track to passage and becoming law.

05:49:13.100 --> 05:49:17.100
I do hope that we will consider the unintended consequences that were mentioned earlier.

05:49:17.100 --> 05:49:22.100
And that if we're truly looking to protect all cans and not just those.

05:49:23.100 --> 05:49:34.100
We're looking to protect all cans and we'll make sure to enact hate crimes legislation in a separate bill later on.

05:49:34.100 --> 05:49:45.100
You know, I got involved in this whole political process because I was represented by someone who I believed after talking to folks across my district helping others.

05:49:46.100 --> 05:49:54.100
Who were running for school board and city council and state legislature that the for the person that represented me was out of touch with our district.

05:49:54.100 --> 05:49:58.100
The person before him was the former chair of judiciary.

05:49:58.100 --> 05:50:07.100
And I think that people oftentimes forget that our former my district went from our former representative Lance Kenzer and former representative Randy Powell.

05:50:07.100 --> 05:50:10.100
To a very proud.

05:50:10.100 --> 05:50:11.100
Out.

05:50:11.100 --> 05:50:12.100
Young.

05:50:12.100 --> 05:50:13.100
Democrat.

