05:50:17.100 --> 05:50:25.100
I hope that you will continue to listen to the people that you're elected to represent as was so eloquently stated last year by one of our colleagues from Wichita.

05:50:25.100 --> 05:50:33.100
We truly do spend some a little bit too much time listening to listening to one another in this building instead of the people that sent us here.

05:50:33.100 --> 05:50:40.100
I hope that you will vote no on how substitute for Senate bill 244. Thank you, Mr. Chair.

