06:04:11.100 --> 06:04:24.100
This is not about skirting the rules, which I heard today. All the rules and procedures were followed. They might be just tasteful to some, but they were followed.

06:04:24.100 --> 06:04:31.100
This is not about what a person looks like or the identity that they claim.

06:04:32.100 --> 06:04:46.100
I want to tell you what it is about. It is about joining 19 other states who have passed this sort of legislation. The most recent was Texas.

06:04:46.100 --> 06:04:51.100
One of the fastest growing states in our nation.

06:04:51.100 --> 06:05:01.100
What this bill does, it restores clarity for administrators and our schools. They want to know what to do about this and this gives them clarity.

06:05:01.100 --> 06:05:10.100
It reaffirms that this is how most government buildings are already structured with a male restroom and a female restroom.

06:05:10.100 --> 06:05:15.100
That's how our government, by far, the majority of the government buildings are structured that way.

06:05:16.100 --> 06:05:28.100
This is about the most recent poll across the country that a majority of Americans agree that men and women should have separate spaces.

06:05:29.100 --> 06:05:43.100
And then something I really want to know, and this is probably the thing that's troubled me the most, is that we've heard this isn't harming what we're doing.

06:05:43.100 --> 06:05:49.100
It's not harming anybody. Why aren't why are we doing this? And I want to tell you, I don't have a prop.

06:05:49.100 --> 06:06:05.100
I have pages of list of sexual assaults that have happened across the country in restrooms.

06:06:05.100 --> 06:06:18.100
For the sake of everyone, I'm not going to go into detail, but I have pages with lists on them of news articles and things that have happened across the country and in Kansas.

06:06:18.100 --> 06:06:27.100
So there is harm going on because we don't have this bill in place because right now anyone can walk in any bathroom.

06:06:27.100 --> 06:06:33.100
This is about making it really clear who can go in each restroom.

06:06:33.100 --> 06:06:42.100
This is about making it clear that states have a duty to protect the privacy and the safety of women.

06:06:42.100 --> 06:06:48.100
That's what this is about, the privacy and safety of women.

06:06:48.100 --> 06:07:01.100
This is about the fact that all Kansasans have value because all are made in the image of God, all the born and the unborn.

06:07:01.100 --> 06:07:13.100
This is about the legislative intent because that was part of it. This is what the legislature, that first part of the bill, it's about clarifying our legislative intent.

06:07:13.100 --> 06:07:19.100
This is about accuracy. This is about biology.

06:07:19.100 --> 06:07:26.100
And the last thing I'll say is this is about truth.

